## Data Model

```typescript
interface Todo {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  description?: string;
  completed: boolean;
  createdAt: Date;
  updatedAt: Date;
}
```

## Endpoints

| Method | Path | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------|
| GET | `/todos` | List all todos (with optional query filters) |
| POST | `/todos` | Create new todo |
| GET | `/todos/:id` | Get single todo |
| PUT | `/todos/:id` | Update todo (title, description, completed status) |
| DELETE | `/todos/:id` | Delete todo |

## Request/Response Examples

**POST /todos**
```json
{ "title": "Buy milk", "description": "2% or whole" }
```

**PUT /todos/:id**
```json
{ "title": "Updated title", "completed": true }
```

**GET /todos** response
```json
{
  "data": [
    { "id": "1", "title": "Buy milk", "completed": false, "createdAt": "...", "updatedAt": "..." }
  ],
  "total": 1
}
```

## Optional Enhancements
- Query filters: `GET /todos?completed=true`
- Pagination: `?page=1&limit=10`
- Sorting: `?sort=-createdAt`

